tps://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312373_1363239738226092_2106854729412937022_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y146viEexZEQ7kNvwHkg7dP&_nc_oc=Adoz8s2OLTS14xEG5ro_iM2DgYI0IFd2_y-F_WC-6ukIrYwzbduSXFyhp5FM1AMANAY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBVRoG-1rzof7duagBNXpgTFOqPgJ4OqhRBOI3GjgpbEA&oe=6A4E3F6E"}, {"file_name": "ChallengeMode_Image_02.png", "id": "1188201992987967", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295509_1188201996321300_2111120103698102006_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yCSablUMxywQ7kNvwEeJqsD&_nc_oc=AdqSkIHQ0R_IsdO3cUaev03eBzyCM5PKgZDfqKWx0jcqdruYn_JN7Usv8n34vaCqTSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQACJY3dw5DtSvxvXTye8tUg3sIK1t_BNTpwkfVqUukfaQ&oe=6A4E6C0A"}, {"file_name": "Cosmetics_Image_02.png", "id": "1737987487068873", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295801_1737987493735539_1039395962667216685_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vcmw2uClLjQQ7kNvwEh9NAH&_nc_oc=Adqz-1c4cixk5WetcIH5tfqarv7k_nzlmedJXtMALNaSXZIWrmu2tDMV0DFkr0Kl-wM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBJKhulvSBdDDAtHz271So02vg4-ixgzImejgfV5WWCrg&oe=6A4E5B2B"}, {"file_name": "DodgeLasers_02.png", "id": "3637904013182167", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294007_3637904023182166_4032639804070807573_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5bytjTirO4sQ7kNvwFkcutt&_nc_oc=AdqiPt0d0gJsFTywNTuUCB1yCEmN-Y-Yi4_Vt3N6SV6qgFzQ08mmpT2A01-ZHDligkE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAMpCUQwlZ8dy50dkJ-mVY7hBJNABfeNZI-L3YZ3kOyUQ&oe=6A4E4831"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Landscape_New.png", "id": "898823102474350", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499299808_898823109141016_4587002048357409884_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q2Sm-oyXvGUQ7kNvwGxUT8Z&_nc_oc=AdpvwEisa-GNpGkRR0jrMcDpMxNxylHqA-sU9nqeZfocsaBl0avET7IXDBQx_XmlEYA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCUPFRZjuo-dRZNhvWoln-abCYEqsiv7id1kTqUf0z_Pg&oe=6A4E47F8"}, "display_name": "Punch Bomb", "keywords": ["Punch", "Arcade", "Bomb", "Game", "Challenge"], "long_description": "# Punch Bomb\nis a fast-paced 360\u00b0 action arcade game where you punch bombs away before they explode.\n\nBuilt for those who love a challenge.\n\nClimb the global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Classic Mode\nSurvive as long as you can! Punch a variety of bombs away from you before they explode, dodge dangerous laser obstacles, hit targets, and rack up huge combos.\n{4009259875886708}\n\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Blitz Mode\n\nRace against the clock to get a high score within the time limit! Bombs no longer explode, and targets extend your time. \n{1063827595628759}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Challenge Mode\nComplete a fun collection of challenges that put your speed and accuracy to the test!\n{1207719874395696}\n\n\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udc4a\n\n# Unique Cosmetics\nUnlock unique cosmetics by **playing the game** and mastering its challenges. Each cosmetic has its own visual flair!\n\n\n\n\n{1198946195348915}", "short_description": "Punch bombs away from you before they explode while racking up combos, dodging dangerous laser obstacles, and hitting targets! Compete in global leaderboards across 3 punchable game modes!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_priv